 {
  "_comment": "AI conversation box (free-text chat with an NPC). Visible during an AI conversation; speaker + scrollback history (bound) + a text-input field. Wired by the host (UI::setupAIDialogue): dialogue.aiActive/aiSpeaker/aiHistory providers + the ai_input field's submit -> DialogueSystem::submitPlayerMessage. Replaces the ImGui renderDialogueBox AI branch (docs/HudSystem.md §11a).",
  "id": "hud_ai_dialogue",
  "anchor": "BottomCenter",
  "offset": [
   0,
   -20
  ],
  "size": [
   840,
   320
  ],
  "showBackground": true,
  "visibleWhen": "dialogue.aiActive",
  "children": [
   {
    "type": "label",
    "id": "ai_speaker",
    "bind": "dialogue.aiSpeaker",
    "text": "",
    "isTitle": true,
    "size": [
     800,
     30
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "label",
    "id": "ai_history",
    "bind": "dialogue.aiHistory",
    "text": "",
    "wrapWidth": 800,
    "size": [
     800,
     210
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "textinput",
    "id": "ai_input",
    "placeholder": "Type a message — Enter to send,  Esc to end",
    "size": [
     800,
     34
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
